- Uh, he could have gotten that anywhere.

235
00:12:53,773 --> 00:12:55,692
Uh, surely it isn't what we think.

236
00:12:56,443 --> 00:12:57,526
It isn't right?

237
00:12:57,527 --> 00:12:59,695
But it is. It was a zombie.

238
00:12:59,696 --> 00:13:01,697
- You...
- Shit.

239
00:13:01,698 --> 00:13:03,782
- [Arron Park] Whoa.
- What? What are you doing?

240
00:13:03,783 --> 00:13:05,701
- Huh?
- Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa.

241
00:13:05,702 --> 00:13:08,788
He told us he was bit, didn't he?
He could turn any minute.

242
00:13:09,289 --> 00:13:10,498
He's a danger to us all.

243
00:13:10,499 --> 00:13:11,707
He hasn't turned yet.

244
00:13:11,708 --> 00:13:13,709
You need to relax and lower your gun.

245
00:13:13,710 --> 00:13:16,253
That's right, soldier.
Kyung-sik, lower the gun, huh?

246
00:13:16,254 --> 00:13:17,588
You asshole.

247
00:13:17,589 --> 00:13:19,715
We need to keep moving
and get out of here.

248
00:13:19,716 --> 00:13:20,759
Lower it.

249
00:13:23,220 --> 00:13:26,305
Honestly, I don't think
he should ride with us either.

250
00:13:26,306 --> 00:13:28,224
Let's close the door and keep going.

251
00:13:28,225 --> 00:13:29,976
Wait, hold on for a second.

252
00:13:30,769 --> 00:13:33,146
That bite was made
a couple of hours ago, right?

253
00:13:33,688 --> 00:13:35,272
That means he isn't turning.

254
00:13:35,273 --> 00:13:37,691
Since you aren't turning,
you can come with us.

255
00:13:37,692 --> 00:13:40,028
No way in hell. It's too dangerous.

256
00:13:41,905 --> 00:13:43,114
Let him come with us.

257
00:13:43,615 --> 00:13:45,366
[Soo-jeong sobbing]

258
00:13:45,367 --> 00:13:47,910
- Please, you guys.
- [Arron Park] It's okay.

259
00:13:47,911 --> 00:13:50,664
He's right. It's too dangerous.
You guys go ahead.

260
00:13:51,248 --> 00:13:52,581
[Soo-jeong sobbing]

261
00:13:52,582 --> 00:13:54,709
Hey, look. [chuckles]

262
00:13:55,252 --> 00:13:56,794
If I were to bite you...

263
00:13:56,795 --> 00:13:58,463
[Soo-jeong crying]

264
00:13:59,256 --> 00:14:01,049
I couldn't forgive myself for it.

265
00:14:03,218 --> 00:14:04,636
Don't cry. Okay?

266
00:14:07,180 --> 00:14:09,599
[heroic music playing]

267
00:14:10,475 --> 00:14:11,518
Oh, wait. Wait.

268
00:14:18,858 --> 00:14:22,487
Manager, uh, thank you for everything.

269
00:14:24,656 --> 00:14:26,324
I will never forget you.

270
00:14:27,784 --> 00:14:29,578
[sobbing]

271
00:14:34,874 --> 00:14:37,209
- [loud thudding]
- [all exclaiming]

272
00:14:37,210 --> 00:14:38,795
[Paolo] Oh, shit.

273
00:14:39,588 --> 00:14:40,421
What is it?

274
00:14:40,422 --> 00:14:42,257
[thudding continues]

275
00:14:42,841 --> 00:14:44,843
[distant snarling]

276
00:14:46,344 --> 00:14:47,928
- Get out now!
- [Soo-jeong yelps]

277
00:14:47,929 --> 00:14:49,764
[zombies snarling]

278
00:14:50,974 --> 00:14:53,226
- [indistinct yelling]
- [Young-joo crying]

279
00:14:58,356 --> 00:14:59,982
[woman 1 crying]

280
00:14:59,983 --> 00:15:02,067
You should get on. You can get on.

281
00:15:02,068 --> 00:15:03,111
Come on.

282
00:15:09,075 --> 00:15:11,077
[indistinct yelling continues]

283
00:15:12,162 --> 00:15:14,372
[woman 2 sobbing]

284
00:15:19,586 --> 00:15:21,879
[woman 3 on PA]
<i>The train is about to depart.</i>

285
00:15:21,880 --> 00:15:24,757
<i>Stay behind the yellow line
as the doors are closing.</i>

286
00:15:24,758 --> 00:15:26,675
<i>- For your safety, please stand...</i>
- Thank you.

287
00:15:26,676 --> 00:15:28,510
- [kid] Grandma!
- [Grandma] Kyung-soo.

288
00:15:28,511 --> 00:15:30,679
- [Kyung-soo] Grandma.
- [Grandma] It's okay.

289
00:15:30,680 --> 00:15:32,514
It's okay. You'll be okay.

290
00:15:32,515 --> 00:15:35,392
- [Kyung-soo] Grandma.
- Just get off at the last station.

291
00:15:35,393 --> 00:15:37,311
- I'm so scared.
- [Grandma] Wait for me.

292
00:15:37,312 --> 00:15:38,729
I'll be there soon.

293
00:15:38,730 --> 00:15:40,856
- [Kyung-soo] Hurry.
- [Grandma] Kyung-soo.

294
00:15:40,857 --> 00:15:44,026
- [Young-joo] It's leaving, careful.
- [Grandma] I'll get you. Wait.

295
00:15:44,027 --> 00:15:46,195
- I'll find a way.
- [Kyung-soo crying]

296
00:15:46,196 --> 00:15:47,863
Don't forget. Wait for me.

297
00:15:47,864 --> 00:15:50,157
- [Young-joo] Please stop!
- No, no. I'll be there.

298
00:15:50,158 --> 00:15:52,369
- Just wait!
- Please, come here.

299
00:15:53,411 --> 00:15:55,372
[Grandma sobbing]

300
00:15:58,333 --> 00:15:59,959
I promise he'll be okay.

301
00:16:00,752 --> 00:16:02,002
[gasps]

302
00:16:02,003 --> 00:16:03,295
[Grandma] Oh, God.

303
00:16:03,296 --> 00:16:04,714
Kyung-soo!

304
00:16:05,965 --> 00:16:08,259
[zombies snarling]

305
00:16:12,555 --> 00:16:15,100
- [woman 4 screaming]
- [man yells] No!

306
00:16:16,059 --> 00:16:17,769
[woman 5] No!

307
00:16:25,568 --> 00:16:28,405
[pensive music playing]

308
00:16:33,034 --> 00:16:35,036
[pensive music continues]

309
00:16:38,832 --> 00:16:40,208
You saved me.

310
00:16:42,377 --> 00:16:44,587
[Grandma breathing shakily]

311
00:16:46,297 --> 00:16:47,424
I'll kill you.

312
00:16:48,758 --> 00:16:51,343
[gasps] What are you doing?

313
00:16:51,344 --> 00:16:53,763
- [Grandma panting]
- [cell phone ringing]

314
00:16:54,889 --> 00:16:56,807
[woman 3] <i>The train bound for Suseo...</i>

315
00:16:56,808 --> 00:16:58,767
- [Grandma] You fuckin' monsters.
- Wait.

316
00:16:58,768 --> 00:17:01,812
- [Grandma] I'll kill you all.
- [Young-joo] Wait. Ma'am, wait.

317
00:17:01,813 --> 00:17:05,149
- [Grandma] Kyung-soo!
- [indistinct announcement on PA]

318
00:17:05,150 --> 00:17:07,902
Come back here, please.
It's too dangerous.

319
00:17:09,529 --> 00:17:10,863
Ma'am. Wait.

320
00:17:10,864 --> 00:17:13,073
[bell chiming]

321
00:17:13,074 --> 00:17:15,577
- [Grandma] Kyung-soo!
- [train blowing horn]

322
00:17:25,170 --> 00:17:26,920
[train continues blowing horn]

323
00:17:26,921 --> 00:17:28,256
[brakes screeching]

324
00:17:29,674 --> 00:17:30,800
[brakes thud]

325
00:17:33,219 --> 00:17:35,846
- [gasps] Oh, my God.
- [woman 3] <i>The doors are opening.</i>

326
00:17:35,847 --> 00:17:38,265
- [Young-joo] Ma'am.
- [woman 3] <i>For your safety,</i>

327
00:17:38,266 --> 00:17:42,144
<i>- please stand behind the yellow line.</i>
- Are you okay? Come on. We gotta go.

328
00:17:42,145 --> 00:17:44,272
- [Grandma moans, coughs]
- [grunts]

329
00:17:46,232 --> 00:17:50,528
[sobbing] Oh, my Kyung-soo.
My dear, Kyung-soo.

330
00:17:51,196 --> 00:17:54,364
- [indistinct announcement on PA]
- Stay close to the wall.

331
00:17:54,365 --> 00:17:57,034
[woman 3] <i>For your safety,
please stand behind...</i>

332
00:17:57,035 --> 00:17:59,286
It's dangerous. So, please just stay here.

333
00:17:59,287 --> 00:18:00,788
[Grandma panting]

334
00:18:00,789 --> 00:18:02,998
[woman 3] <i>Please board
in an orderly fashion.</i>

335
00:18:02,999 --> 00:18:05,709
<i>Please wait behind the yellow line.</i>

336
00:18:05,710 --> 00:18:06,961
[Young-joo gasps]

337
00:18:11,257 --> 00:18:13,885
[Young-joo breathing shakily]

338
00:18:15,929 --> 00:18:17,304
[exclaims] Hey, ma'am.

339
00:18:17,305 --> 00:18:19,390
[train engine turns over]

340
00:18:20,433 --> 00:18:22,393
[Young-joo grunting]

341
00:18:23,520 --> 00:18:24,354
[screams]

342
00:18:33,905 --> 00:18:35,907
[snarling]

343
00:18:40,245 --> 00:18:41,412
[Young-joo] Ma'am. Ma'am.

344
00:18:44,207 --> 00:18:46,543
- [Grandma snarls]
- [screaming]

345
00:18:48,336 --> 00:18:49,837
[Grandma growling]

346
00:18:49,838 --> 00:18:50,922
[screaming]

347
00:18:54,926 --> 00:18:56,928
[Grandma continues growling]

348
00:18:59,681 --> 00:19:00,640
[squelching]

349
00:19:05,520 --> 00:19:07,564
[Young-joo crying]

350
00:19:13,528 --> 00:19:15,530
[panting]

351
00:19:22,871 --> 00:19:24,956
[pensive music playing]

352
00:19:25,832 --> 00:19:27,834
[crying]

353
00:19:56,613 --> 00:19:57,530
Yes,

354
00:20:04,078 --> 00:20:06,080
[pensive music continues]

355
00:20:16,716 --> 00:20:18,718
RESTRICTED AREA
AUTHORIZED PERSONNEL ONLY

356
00:20:21,262 --> 00:20:23,222
[softly] God, please help me.

357
00:20:30,521 --> 00:20:31,772
[crashing]

358
00:20:31,773 --> 00:20:33,858
[all whimpering]

359
00:20:35,860 --> 00:20:36,694
[zombies snarling]

360
00:20:45,161 --> 00:20:46,370
[both shouting]

361
00:20:46,371 --> 00:20:48,205
[snarling]

362
00:20:48,206 --> 00:20:50,874
[Paolo screaming]

363
00:20:50,875 --> 00:20:52,417
[growls]

364
00:20:52,418 --> 00:20:53,711
- [yelps]
- [both shouting]

365
00:20:54,462 --> 00:20:56,129
[Paolo] Wait. I can handle this.

366
00:20:56,130 --> 00:20:57,632
I can handle this.

367
00:20:58,549 --> 00:21:01,219
- [zombie snarls]
- [all whimpering]

368
00:21:03,972 --> 00:21:05,431
[zombies snarling]

369
00:21:06,224 --> 00:21:07,392
Oh, oh! [panting]

370
00:21:08,518 --> 00:21:10,185
[In-ho yelps, grunts]

371
00:21:10,186 --> 00:21:12,104
- [Paolo] Move your foot.
- Just me, swear.

372
00:21:12,105 --> 00:21:13,523
[Paolo] Just you, okay.

373
00:21:15,525 --> 00:21:17,527
- [zombies snarling]
- Wait, wait.

374
00:21:18,903 --> 00:21:21,405
Open up. Oh, shit. [yelps]

375
00:21:21,406 --> 00:21:22,532
[zombie snarls]

376
00:21:24,283 --> 00:21:26,577
- [all panting]
- [banging on door]

377
00:21:31,457 --> 00:21:32,457
[In-ho chuckles]

378
00:21:32,458 --> 00:21:34,292
- Fucking hell! Oh, God!
- [screaming]

379
00:21:34,293 --> 00:21:36,586
Go! [panting] Look.

380
00:21:36,587 --> 00:21:38,338
[Soo-jeong] Shit! We're stuck.

381
00:21:38,339 --> 00:21:40,465
- Oh, shit. Access key.
- [banging on door]

382
00:21:40,466 --> 00:21:41,925
Soo-jeong, look. It's a key.

383
00:21:41,926 --> 00:21:44,511
- Then open the goddamn door.
- Oh, my God.

384
00:21:44,512 --> 00:21:46,722
- Oh, please. Please. Oh, shit.
- [door lock beeps]

385
00:21:46,723 --> 00:21:48,725
- [zombies snarling]
- [Soo-jeong screams]

386
00:21:49,308 --> 00:21:51,601
- [door lock chimes]
- [Gye-young] It worked. Get in.

387
00:21:51,602 --> 00:21:53,228
- Get in.
- [Soo-jeong screams]

388
00:21:53,229 --> 00:21:55,023
[zombie snarls]

389
00:21:56,315 --> 00:21:58,317
- [both panting]
- [kisses]

390
00:22:00,820 --> 00:22:01,654
[AC beeps]

391
00:22:03,322 --> 00:22:04,282
[Soo-jeong] Huh?

392
00:22:06,367 --> 00:22:07,534
[man 1 shouting]

393
00:22:07,535 --> 00:22:10,121
[zombies snarling]

394
00:22:12,540 --> 00:22:14,124
[man 2 panting]

395
00:22:14,125 --> 00:22:16,043
Hey, hey, hey. Don't go that way.

396
00:22:16,044 --> 00:22:18,378
Over there. The other side.
That way. That way.

397
00:22:18,379 --> 00:22:20,297
Over there. Hurry up, and go now.

398
00:22:20,298 --> 00:22:22,133
- [Young-man] Kyung-sik, hurry.
- Go!

399
00:22:22,800 --> 00:22:23,760
[staple gun clicking]

400
00:22:25,970 --> 00:22:27,220
Stupid piece of shit.

401
00:22:27,221 --> 00:22:28,264
[growling]

402
00:22:29,432 --> 00:22:30,600
[grunts]

403
00:22:31,809 --> 00:22:34,102
- [grunting]
- [zombie snarls]

404
00:22:34,103 --> 00:22:36,064
[Young-man] Manager. Hey, hurry up!

405
00:22:36,773 --> 00:22:39,150
Huh? Shit.

406
00:22:40,610 --> 00:22:42,820
- [both panting]
- Damn it!

407
00:22:43,446 --> 00:22:45,823
- [both panting]
- [Young-man] Come on. Go!

408
00:22:49,452 --> 00:22:50,452
- Fucking hell.
- Damn it.

409
00:22:50,453 --> 00:22:51,871
[Young-man] Come. This way.

410
00:22:53,039 --> 00:22:54,040
Damn it.

411
00:22:55,625 --> 00:22:56,458
Oh!

412
00:22:56,459 --> 00:22:58,502
Kyung-sik! This one's open.

413
00:22:58,503 --> 00:23:01,379
- Run, manager. Run, manager.
- [Kyung-sik] Go!

414
00:23:01,380 --> 00:23:05,008
- [Young-man yelps] What're you doing?
- [Arron Park] No, don't close it.

415
00:23:05,009 --> 00:23:09,012
Wait! Huh? What the hell?

416
00:23:09,013 --> 00:23:12,474
- Hey, what's wrong with you?
- Letting him inside is suicide.

417
00:23:12,475 --> 00:23:13,809
[banging on door]

418
00:23:13,810 --> 00:23:15,936
[Arron Park] Come on. Open!
What's your problem?

419
00:23:15,937 --> 00:23:17,521
[Young-man] Hey!

420
00:23:17,522 --> 00:23:19,439
[Arron Park] Hey. Hey!

421
00:23:19,440 --> 00:23:21,692
Have you lost it? Step aside.

422
00:23:22,276 --> 00:23:23,652
I said move, damn it.

423
00:23:23,653 --> 00:23:25,570
Get your fucking shit together, sir.

424
00:23:25,571 --> 00:23:27,657
[Arron Park] Open the door! Hey!

425
00:23:28,491 --> 00:23:30,493
[zombies snarling]

426
00:23:31,494 --> 00:23:34,497
- [Arron Park sighs]
- [heroic music playing]

427
00:23:38,668 --> 00:23:40,670
[zombies snarling]

428
00:23:46,259 --> 00:23:47,260
[chuckles]

429
00:23:48,719 --> 00:23:50,513
I suppose it's been a good run.

430
00:23:52,056 --> 00:23:53,182
[grunts]

431
00:23:54,142 --> 00:23:56,811
- [snarling]
- [heroic music continues]

432
00:24:00,815 --> 00:24:02,233
- [music stops]
- [Arron Park] Hmm?

433
00:24:05,486 --> 00:24:07,488
[comical music playing]

434
00:24:20,668 --> 00:24:23,171
Want a bite? Maybe a nibble? Small one?

435
00:24:25,256 --> 00:24:27,591
[comical music plays]

436
00:24:27,592 --> 00:24:28,801
Why did you do that?

437
00:24:29,844 --> 00:24:31,596
There was plenty of time to let him in.

438
00:24:32,221 --> 00:24:34,974
With that bite on his ankle,
it's only a matter of time.

439
00:24:35,474 --> 00:24:38,186
He'll eventually turn
into a zombie and murder us.

440
00:24:39,020 --> 00:24:40,395
- This is serious.
- Hey!

441
00:24:40,396 --> 00:24:41,772
- [doorbell chiming]
- Huh?

442
00:24:43,024 --> 00:24:45,526
- [Kyung-sik] Huh?
- [doorbell chiming]

443
00:24:45,985 --> 00:24:48,404
- [Arron Park] I'm not dead yet.
- [Kyung-sik] Huh?

444
00:24:52,283 --> 00:24:54,994
And no bites either. Not one.

445
00:24:56,662 --> 00:24:59,581
I have a feeling that
I'm not gonna die out here.

446
00:24:59,582 --> 00:25:01,917
Forgive us, Manager Park.

447
00:25:01,918 --> 00:25:04,002
No, no, no, no.
It's all right, Sergeant Kim.

448
00:25:04,003 --> 00:25:05,588
There's no need to say sorry.

449
00:25:08,841 --> 00:25:09,926
Private Hwang?

450
00:25:10,927 --> 00:25:12,802
You got bitten. You've been infected.

451
00:25:12,803 --> 00:25:14,805
- [zombie snarling]
- You're lying.

452
00:25:15,389 --> 00:25:16,849
You're gonna attack us.

453
00:25:17,642 --> 00:25:20,977
[Arron Park] Hey, Private.
I don't think I quite enjoy the way

454
00:25:20,978 --> 00:25:23,147
that you're talking to me. [scoffs]

455
00:25:25,524 --> 00:25:27,026
I mean...

456
00:25:28,736 --> 00:25:31,572
Not that it matters. Let me tell you...

457
00:25:34,742 --> 00:25:36,327
that I'll never forget this.

458
00:25:38,621 --> 00:25:39,454
[zombie snarls]

459
00:25:39,455 --> 00:25:40,373
[gasps]

460
00:25:42,416 --> 00:25:44,877
[laughing]

461
00:25:45,962 --> 00:25:48,506
Want a drink? Here we go.

462
00:25:49,131 --> 00:25:50,216
Fuck that guy.

463
00:25:52,468 --> 00:25:53,677
[door unlocks]

464
00:25:53,678 --> 00:25:55,137
[hinges squeaking]

465
00:25:56,138 --> 00:25:57,932
[machines whirring]

466
00:25:58,933 --> 00:25:59,892
[woman] Young-joo.

467
00:26:01,352 --> 00:26:03,187
- [emotional music playing]
- [Young-joo sobs]

468
00:26:11,362 --> 00:26:13,364
[sniffles]

469
00:26:21,956 --> 00:26:23,499
[zombies snarling]

470
00:26:27,461 --> 00:26:29,004
[Young-joo sighs]

471
00:26:29,005 --> 00:26:30,214
[woman] Young-joo.

472
00:26:39,807 --> 00:26:41,809
[puzzling music playing]

473
00:26:44,103 --> 00:26:46,105
[breathing heavily]

474
00:26:55,740 --> 00:26:57,365
[panting]

475
00:26:57,366 --> 00:26:58,576
[woman] Young-joo.

476
00:27:05,499 --> 00:27:07,084
RESTRICTED AREA
AUTHORIZED PERSONNEL ONLY

477
00:27:10,921 --> 00:27:13,132
[breathing shakily]

478
00:27:18,346 --> 00:27:19,179
[light clicks]

479
00:27:19,180 --> 00:27:22,266
- [electricity whirring]
- [continues breathing shakily]

480
00:27:33,277 --> 00:27:34,653
